      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart E \u2014 Powerplant",
      "title_at_revision": "Fuel system lightning protection",
      "text": "The fuel system must be designed and arranged to prevent the ignition of fuel vapour within the system by \u2013 (a) Direct lightning strikes to areas having a high probability of stroke attachment; (b) Swept lightning strokes on areas where swept strokes are highly probable; and (c) Corona or streamering at fuel vent outlets.",
